🎯 What’s the Purpose of This Project?
🔬 Educational & Structural
This project is meant to teach the structure of a real ML pipeline:

🧱 Model architecture (CNN)

⚙️ Dataset creation/loading

🧪 Training with loss feedback

📦 Saving data or outputs (images)

It's like a "sandbox" or template that you can:

Replace the random images with real data (like handwritten symbols, micro scans, etc.)

Expand the model for more complex tasks